## Command

```shell
biome inspect plugins
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    { "path": "@acme/testing/noFocusedTests", "includes": ["src/**/*.test.ts"] }
  ],
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["**/*.test.ts"],
      "plugins": [
        "@acme/testing/presets/recommended",
        "@acme/testing/noFakeTimers"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

## `node_modules/@acme/testing/biome-manifest.json`

```json
{"plugins":{"presets":{"recommended":["noFocusedTests"]},"rules":[{"noFakeTimers":"rules/noFakeTimers.grit","noFocusedTests":"rules/noFocusedTests.grit"}]},"version":1}
```

## `node_modules/@acme/testing/package.json`

```json
{"exports":{"biome":"./biome-manifest.json","default":"./index.js"},"name":"@acme/testing"}
```

## `node_modules/@acme/testing/rules/noFakeTimers.grit`

```grit
`console.log($message)`
```

