  i The configuration enables 2 plugin rules.
  
  Rules that apply only to matching files
  
  - @acme/testing/noFakeTimers, for files matching override includes: [**/*.test.ts] (listed directly)
  - @acme/testing/noFocusedTests, for files matching any of:
    - includes: [src/**/*.test.ts] (listed directly)
    - override includes: [**/*.test.ts] (presets/recommended)
  

